LIST
STATE everything is down and we have a demo with our biggest client at noon.
NOUL q0 | does the customer need a reply within the hour?
CHOICE q1 | which team should handle it? | 0=service down ; 1=charges, refunds ; 2=requests, how-to
SCORE q2 | how upset is the customer? | calm ; annoyed ; furious
STATE the invoice looks wrong again. second time this quarter.
NOUL q3 | is this urgent?
CHOICE q4 | which team should handle it? | 0=service down ; 1=charges, refunds ; 2=requests, how-to
SCORE q5 | how upset is the customer? | calm ; annoyed ; furious
MEM
QUIT
